 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "No motif on Isa or the disciples; a scroll for the Torah, a door for what is made lawful, footsteps for the straight path, a seal for the disciples' pledge. STAGING v4: 50-51: Isa (blue drop «عيسى») speaks to the Children of Israel in a town and points at them on «وأطيعون»; scroll plate for the Torah (ended before «ولأحل»), footsteps for the straight path. No gesture by the people on the command «فاعبدوه». 52: the people turn away on «الكفر» (As-Sa'di: they did not submit to him); the plot to kill him is not drawn. The disciples, an uncountable believers group (their number is not given), appear on «قال الحواريون» and speak; seal plate for their pledge. Wide shots only."
 },
